  "details": "Hi! I think that you should be able to edit stuff from your already uploaded avatars.\n\nNot any edits to the avatar itself, but just the stuff that is seen in your menu when you go to change avatars. So just the picture and the name of the avatar.\n\nThe reason for the picture is because I downloaded some avatars almost a year ago when i downloaded and used unity for the sole purpose of having my own downloaded avatars, so I didn't even know how to move the camera, so most of the time it's just showing their legs or their feet or something.\n\nAlong the same lines, I just named them stupid things like \"girl with ears\" or whatever because at that point we couldn't save avatars so I just named them whatever so I could remember what it was, especially since I didn't know how to move the camera lol",
